WEBVTT

01:29.320 --> 01:34.450
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.910 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 14]

01:37.979 --> 01:41.710
[In Loving Memory]

01:41.350 --> 01:44.310
This photo of your grandma is really nice.

01:48.479 --> 01:50.539
Looking at the album, I just realized

01:51.650 --> 01:53.979
that over the years we've been neighbors,

01:54.229 --> 01:55.830
we've long been like family.

01:57.000 --> 01:57.710
In the past,

01:58.000 --> 01:58.590
when I was too busy

01:58.590 --> 01:59.920
to manage things,

02:00.870 --> 02:02.800
your grandma would go to the school

02:02.930 --> 02:04.000
to pick up Yan for me

02:05.340 --> 02:06.870
and help him with his meals.

02:07.350 --> 02:08.880
A few times when I came back,

02:09.240 --> 02:11.700
Yan had already
fallen asleep at your place.

02:12.730 --> 02:14.060
Did that really happen?

02:17.800 --> 02:18.600
Your grandma

02:19.010 --> 02:20.780
always used her own way

02:21.490 --> 02:22.890
to take care of everyone.

02:23.490 --> 02:24.560
Zhou Wan.

02:23.850 --> 02:26.150
[In Loving Memory]

02:26.360 --> 02:27.400
We came to say goodbye

02:27.400 --> 02:28.680
to your grandma.

02:37.930 --> 02:39.660
Who said you could come in here?

02:40.680 --> 02:41.890
Rude girl.

02:42.520 --> 02:44.720
You don't even know how to say thank you.

02:46.050 --> 02:47.380
Arrange them properly.

02:48.650 --> 02:49.420
Mr. Fang.

02:49.890 --> 02:50.810
The wreaths have been set up.

02:50.810 --> 02:51.440
All right.

02:51.860 --> 02:52.860
You all go out.

02:55.800 --> 02:56.329
Let's go.

02:58.240 --> 02:58.930
Wan.

03:00.450 --> 03:01.400
Ms. Jiang.

03:01.460 --> 03:03.940
Let me handle this here.

03:05.560 --> 03:06.800
Thank you for your hard work.

03:06.800 --> 03:07.560
Take a rest.

03:08.050 --> 03:08.560
Okay.

03:09.330 --> 03:11.080
Call us if you need anything.

03:11.930 --> 03:13.130
Thank you, Ms. Jiang.

03:14.450 --> 03:15.710
Sorry for the trouble.

03:46.980 --> 03:52.870
[With Deepest Sympathy]

03:59.290 --> 04:00.220
My condolences.

04:05.400 --> 04:06.600
Sir, why are you here?

04:07.510 --> 04:09.010
The neighbors told me.

04:09.620 --> 04:12.370
I've known Fen for so long,

04:12.500 --> 04:13.650
how could I not come?

04:15.170 --> 04:17.029
I have some business to attend to,

04:17.290 --> 04:18.290
so I'll get going.

04:21.240 --> 04:22.170
I'll see you out.

04:24.040 --> 04:25.550
You don't have to pay rent

04:25.880 --> 04:27.210
for the next few months.

04:27.530 --> 04:29.560
I'll tell Luo He later.

04:30.430 --> 04:31.980
I guess that kid

04:32.120 --> 04:34.580
has been causing you
a lot of trouble lately.

04:35.409 --> 04:36.240
It's fine.

04:36.320 --> 04:37.580
I've already saved up.

04:37.970 --> 04:38.650
9,000.

04:38.250 --> 04:46.680
[With Deepest Sympathy]

04:38.650 --> 04:39.650
3,000 a month.

04:39.780 --> 04:41.510
I've already given it to Luo He.

04:41.610 --> 04:42.170
How much?

04:43.290 --> 04:44.000
9,000.

04:47.970 --> 04:48.770
What's wrong?

04:51.810 --> 04:52.400
Boss.

04:54.100 --> 04:57.980
[Please Respect the Deceased.
No Smoking in the Memorial Hall.]

04:54.240 --> 04:54.880
Nothing.

04:55.610 --> 04:57.540
If you need anything in the future,

04:57.720 --> 04:58.640
contact me directly.

04:58.000 --> 05:01.570
[Pingchuan Funeral Services Center]

05:07.760 --> 05:08.410
Mr. Fang.

05:08.410 --> 05:09.530
Look at this girl.

05:09.530 --> 05:10.320
She has no manners at all.

05:10.320 --> 05:11.120
We sent two wreaths,

05:11.120 --> 05:11.970
and she didn't even say thank you.

05:11.970 --> 05:12.610
Shut up.

05:13.490 --> 05:17.180
[Pingchuan Funeral Services Center]

05:13.880 --> 05:17.050
Remember, I owe Fen
for what she's done for me.

05:20.090 --> 05:21.220
Take care, Mr. Fang.

05:30.930 --> 05:33.870
[Fondly Remembering Huang Xuefen]

05:31.880 --> 05:34.140
With such a grand setup, no one showed up.

05:43.980 --> 05:46.860
[Pingchuan Funeral Services Center]

05:55.409 --> 05:56.000
Bro.

05:56.560 --> 05:57.090
Let's go.

05:57.680 --> 05:58.630
Let's go.

05:58.659 --> 05:59.730
Let's go.

07:22.680 --> 07:23.610
My condolences.

07:24.410 --> 07:25.340
My condolences.

07:26.200 --> 07:27.800
I have something to give you.

07:29.320 --> 07:30.240
What is this?

07:30.530 --> 07:31.560
See for yourself.

07:41.180 --> 07:46.350
[With Deepest Sympathy]

07:56.290 --> 07:57.090
Do I look good?

07:57.760 --> 07:58.290
Yes.

07:59.200 --> 08:00.580
Ma'am, look here.

08:01.120 --> 08:02.520
Okay, I look here, right?

08:03.270 --> 08:04.610
I'll take off my coat.

08:04.850 --> 08:05.490
Wait a moment.

08:05.490 --> 08:06.350
No rush, Ma'am.

08:14.220 --> 08:15.600
I didn't expect

08:16.210 --> 08:18.480
to be fashionable right before the end

08:18.510 --> 08:19.840
and record such a video.

08:20.290 --> 08:21.060
Well,

08:22.000 --> 08:23.360
it's just in case

08:23.360 --> 08:24.490
I leave too suddenly

08:24.560 --> 08:26.490
and don't have time to say goodbye.

08:26.730 --> 08:29.530
So I want to say a few words first,

08:29.610 --> 08:31.510
but the premise is no crying.

08:32.409 --> 08:33.559
Especially you, Kang.

08:33.559 --> 08:34.320
Don't cry.

08:34.320 --> 08:35.720
-At your age...
-I'm smiling.

08:35.720 --> 08:38.049
-You look ugly when you cry.
-I’m smiling.

08:40.960 --> 08:42.330
In my life,

08:43.200 --> 08:45.320
I've experienced storms,

08:46.200 --> 08:47.400
suffered hardships,

08:47.890 --> 08:49.220
and enjoyed blessings.

08:50.370 --> 08:51.840
There might be regrets,

08:52.770 --> 08:54.720
but life overall

08:55.170 --> 08:56.480
has been happy.

08:57.650 --> 08:59.510
Now that I'm leaving,

09:00.200 --> 09:01.800
the only one I can't let go of,

09:02.250 --> 09:03.180
needless to say,

09:03.770 --> 09:05.010
as everyone knows,

09:06.200 --> 09:07.930
is my precious Wan.

09:09.290 --> 09:12.010
A smart, kind,

09:13.170 --> 09:14.680
and sensitive child.

09:15.410 --> 09:16.560
Because of me,

09:17.200 --> 09:18.290
she inevitably

09:19.410 --> 09:20.800
missed out on a lot.

09:23.650 --> 09:24.530
Wan,

09:26.010 --> 09:27.440
although there are many things

09:27.440 --> 09:28.950
you don't tell me.

09:29.680 --> 09:31.410
But I'm not confused.

09:31.650 --> 09:33.650
I understand it all.

09:34.440 --> 09:35.520
I know

09:35.930 --> 09:37.650
what you have done for me

09:38.410 --> 09:40.270
and how much you have sacrificed.

09:41.200 --> 09:42.600
Now that I'm gone,

09:43.170 --> 09:44.370
don't treat this

09:44.370 --> 09:45.530
as a sad farewell.

09:46.200 --> 09:47.250
You should know

09:47.890 --> 09:49.010
that this farewell

09:49.010 --> 09:50.010
is also the beginning of

09:50.010 --> 09:51.670
another chapter in your life.

09:52.930 --> 09:53.720
Child,

09:55.050 --> 09:56.250
I hope you

09:56.930 --> 09:58.840
will go to college and study hard.

09:59.890 --> 10:00.550
You should

10:00.800 --> 10:03.050
go see the world outside.

10:03.370 --> 10:04.800
Try things

10:04.960 --> 10:06.900
you've always wanted to try

10:07.200 --> 10:09.050
but never dared to.

10:10.200 --> 10:12.480
You only live once.

10:13.410 --> 10:14.560
I hope you

10:14.600 --> 10:16.930
can live a wonderful life.

10:17.770 --> 10:19.190
I hope you can live

10:19.250 --> 10:21.510
the life you want the most.

10:22.410 --> 10:23.800
I won't leave.

10:24.600 --> 10:25.770
I will always

10:25.770 --> 10:27.890
watch you with a smile

10:28.600 --> 10:29.800
and keep you company.

10:30.770 --> 10:32.290
My darling Wan.

10:41.560 --> 10:42.250
Is it done?

10:42.960 --> 10:44.130
Did I say it okay?

10:44.170 --> 10:45.410
Yes, very well.

10:45.410 --> 10:46.080
Good.

10:50.380 --> 10:54.830
[In Loving Memory]

11:26.920 --> 11:28.370
I can go back by myself.

11:29.370 --> 11:30.440
Just for one night.

11:30.850 --> 11:32.450
I want to be alone for a while.

11:32.960 --> 11:34.820
Actually, I can keep you company.

11:36.960 --> 11:37.690
Give it to me.

11:52.650 --> 11:53.910
I will take care of her.

11:55.480 --> 11:56.010
Okay.

11:56.600 --> 11:59.460
Then I will come over
first thing tomorrow morning.

12:11.320 --> 12:13.380
I can wear this for the toasts, right?

12:13.480 --> 12:14.010
Yes.

12:15.650 --> 12:16.510
Let me try it on.

12:16.530 --> 12:16.930
Okay.

12:17.260 --> 12:17.930
Xixiao.

12:18.560 --> 12:19.770
You are finally back.

12:19.840 --> 12:21.970
Why did you call me back in such a hurry?

12:22.320 --> 12:23.450
Your dad is worried.

12:25.320 --> 12:26.600
Don't worry.

12:26.650 --> 12:28.050
He has told me everything.

12:28.050 --> 12:28.930
He introduced you

12:28.930 --> 12:30.330
to some foreign friends.

12:30.530 --> 12:33.190
When the time comes,
your basic necessities...

12:35.770 --> 12:36.650
As soon as you board the plane,

12:36.650 --> 12:37.800
I'll send her the money.

12:37.800 --> 12:38.930
This way, Zhou Wan's grandma

12:38.930 --> 12:40.200
can have her surgery sooner.

12:40.200 --> 12:40.800
Okay?

12:45.650 --> 12:46.780
Her grandma is dead.

12:49.370 --> 12:50.010
What?

12:53.560 --> 12:54.720
Her grandma is dead?

12:57.560 --> 12:58.690
That's impossible.

12:59.300 --> 13:00.700
How could it be so sudden?

13:02.600 --> 13:03.930
She had such a hard life.

13:04.370 --> 13:05.950
It's a relief in a way.

13:07.130 --> 13:08.390
Is Zhou Wan doing okay?

13:08.890 --> 13:09.650
For her grandma's funeral,

13:09.650 --> 13:10.770
I need to attend in person.

13:10.770 --> 13:11.480
No need.

13:13.320 --> 13:14.920
The funeral is already over.

13:21.080 --> 13:22.680
I know you hate me,

13:23.130 --> 13:24.540
but I'm human too.

13:25.560 --> 13:27.430
My sadness isn't fake.

13:29.010 --> 13:29.650
Xixiao.

13:30.050 --> 13:30.980
After you leave,

13:31.050 --> 13:31.890
I will still send

13:31.890 --> 13:32.930
the money to Wan.

13:34.960 --> 13:35.720
Xixiao.

14:11.960 --> 14:12.560
Mom.

14:13.080 --> 14:13.970
Otherwise,

14:14.680 --> 14:16.250
we should bring Zhou Wan here.

14:16.250 --> 14:17.910
I am really worried about her.

14:21.410 --> 14:22.290
Don't worry.

14:23.170 --> 14:25.370
Wan will take good care of herself.

14:28.130 --> 14:29.060
Before we leave,

14:29.720 --> 14:31.010
go see her more.

14:41.440 --> 14:42.130
Jiang Yan.

14:42.410 --> 14:43.410
It's time to rest.

17:48.480 --> 17:49.200
Zhou Wan.

17:51.720 --> 17:53.780
I brought you some noodles, Zhou Wan.

18:05.760 --> 18:06.480
Zhou Wan.

18:07.240 --> 18:07.930
Zhou Wan!

18:08.810 --> 18:09.570
Zhou Wan!

18:10.650 --> 18:11.500
Zhou Wan!

18:14.930 --> 18:15.570
Zhou Wan!

19:00.520 --> 19:01.170
Zhou Wan!

19:03.130 --> 19:03.760
Zhou Wan!

19:14.000 --> 19:15.570
Zhou Wan! Zhou Wan!

19:16.480 --> 19:17.170
Zhou Wan.

19:22.040 --> 19:22.650
Zhou Wan.

19:23.610 --> 19:24.280
Zhou Wan.

19:33.910 --> 19:36.980
[Outpatient Registration; Cashier]

19:43.040 --> 19:44.170
Luckily, it was found in time

19:44.170 --> 19:45.480
and didn't damage the nerves.

19:45.480 --> 19:46.650
After the treatment,

19:46.650 --> 19:48.440
the poisoning symptoms
have significantly eased.

19:48.440 --> 19:49.440
Don't worry.

19:50.610 --> 19:51.720
The fact that she woke up

19:51.720 --> 19:53.280
means it's nothing serious.

19:53.280 --> 19:55.000
She needs to rest for the next few days

19:55.000 --> 19:56.330
and get plenty of nutrients.

19:56.330 --> 19:57.650
We'll keep her
under observation for a few days.

19:57.650 --> 19:58.890
If there are no further symptoms,

19:58.890 --> 20:00.150
she can be discharged.

20:01.760 --> 20:02.330
Okay.

20:04.520 --> 20:05.580
Thank you, Doctor.

20:56.330 --> 20:57.000
Zhou Wan.

20:57.650 --> 20:58.510
How do you feel?

21:00.130 --> 21:01.260
How are you feeling?

21:10.170 --> 21:11.900
I wasn't trying to kill myself.

21:14.680 --> 21:15.370
I know.

21:24.170 --> 21:25.440
I was just a bit tired.

21:32.850 --> 21:33.710
I know that too.

21:44.170 --> 21:45.730
You should go back first.

21:46.480 --> 21:47.930
I want to rest for a bit.

21:49.680 --> 21:50.610
I'm not leaving.

22:14.720 --> 22:15.450
Let me think.

22:18.680 --> 22:19.240
I got one.

22:20.650 --> 22:22.380
What's between five and seven?

22:23.570 --> 22:24.170
Six.

22:25.370 --> 22:27.170
Between five and seven is "and".

22:29.440 --> 22:30.300
Isn't it funny?

22:30.890 --> 22:31.520
Not funny.

22:31.720 --> 22:32.530
Funny.

22:33.720 --> 22:35.250
Let me think of another one.

22:36.090 --> 22:37.750
This one is definitely funny.

22:38.200 --> 22:39.860
Some people fart really loud.

22:40.410 --> 22:41.270
Do you know why?

22:42.850 --> 22:43.570
Why?

22:45.280 --> 22:46.200
Because when they fart,

22:46.200 --> 22:48.000
they are wearing bell-bottoms.

22:50.130 --> 22:51.530
This one is funny, right?

22:51.930 --> 22:52.610
Not funny.

22:54.280 --> 22:55.850
If it's not funny,
why are you laughing so loud?

22:55.850 --> 22:56.930
Wan didn't laugh.

22:57.200 --> 22:58.130
I think it's very funny.

22:58.130 --> 22:58.610
Then you tell one.

22:58.610 --> 23:00.410
Let's see how funny your joke is.

23:03.190 --> 23:06.080
[Inpatient Building]

23:34.330 --> 23:35.000
I'm sorry.

23:36.960 --> 23:38.890
I didn't take good care of Zhou Wan.

23:44.520 --> 23:46.850
The person you should apologize to is her.

25:22.650 --> 25:23.760
My eyes hurt.

25:24.960 --> 25:26.490
Can you close the curtains?

25:39.890 --> 25:41.890
Discharge procedures are all done.

25:42.980 --> 25:44.780
I want to stay for a few more days.

25:47.890 --> 25:49.960
Why do you want to stay in the hospital?

25:49.960 --> 25:51.620
It's so much better to go home.

25:52.130 --> 25:52.960
And there are other patients

25:52.960 --> 25:53.760
coming in.

25:56.240 --> 25:57.810
It's comfortable here.

25:59.440 --> 26:01.770
And I really don't have
the energy to move.

26:24.520 --> 26:26.120
Drink this before you sleep.

26:28.040 --> 26:29.240
I don't want to drink.

26:31.410 --> 26:33.670
Don't force me to make you drink. Come on.

26:36.200 --> 26:37.760
I said I don't want to drink.

26:38.130 --> 26:39.280
I want to sleep.

26:48.130 --> 26:48.850
Get up.

26:49.680 --> 26:50.370
Zhou Wan.

26:51.570 --> 26:52.770
Let's go get some sun.

26:54.370 --> 26:54.680
Come on.

26:54.680 --> 26:55.540
I don't want to.

26:57.960 --> 26:58.650
If you don't get some sun,

26:58.650 --> 26:59.720
you'll get moldy.

26:59.720 --> 27:01.000
Come out and get some fresh air with me.

27:01.000 --> 27:02.200
What are you doing?

27:02.240 --> 27:05.170
-Let’s go out for some fresh air.
-I said I was sleepy.

27:06.520 --> 27:07.000
You are sleepy?

27:07.000 --> 27:08.680
Then go downstairs
and sleep leaning on me.

27:08.680 --> 27:10.130
Just get some fresh air
with me downstairs, okay?

27:10.130 --> 27:12.460
-Let’s go. Get up.
-Can you leave me alone?

27:14.610 --> 27:15.240
Zhou Wan,

27:16.330 --> 27:17.590
do you think
your grandma would want to see

27:17.590 --> 27:18.520
you like this?

27:18.520 --> 27:19.480
What can I do?

27:20.170 --> 27:21.810
-You don't get any sunlight all day...
-Tell me. What can I do?

27:21.810 --> 27:23.040
...and you hardly eat anything.

27:23.040 --> 27:24.520
-What can I do?
-You don’t even drink water.

27:24.520 --> 27:25.170
Who would want to see

27:25.170 --> 27:25.930
you like this?

27:25.930 --> 27:26.810
I can't be the way

27:26.810 --> 27:27.370
you want me to be anymore.

27:27.370 --> 27:28.380
Everyone comes to
the hospital every day...

27:28.380 --> 27:29.720
-...to care about you.
-When I don't want to smile...

27:29.720 --> 27:30.890
-...stop forcing me to smile.
-Who do you think wants to see...

27:30.890 --> 27:31.570
...you like this?

27:31.570 --> 27:32.570
I can't be the way

27:32.570 --> 27:33.410
you want me to be anymore.

27:33.410 --> 27:34.410
Aren't you good at pretending?

27:34.410 --> 27:35.650
-Go on.
-I can’t.

27:35.650 --> 27:36.610
Pretend you are fine alone.

27:36.610 --> 27:38.130
-Pretend you're doing great all alone.
-My dad passed away.

27:38.130 --> 27:38.890
My grandma passed away too.

27:38.890 --> 27:40.240
I have nothing left.

27:40.280 --> 27:41.680
I really can't do it anymore.

27:41.680 --> 27:43.180
I can't pretend anymore.

27:43.330 --> 27:44.720
I can't pretend anymore.

27:44.720 --> 27:46.280
I'm only 18.

28:10.650 --> 28:11.370
I'm sorry.

28:12.000 --> 28:12.650
Zhou Wan.

28:19.410 --> 28:20.170
I'm sorry.

28:22.170 --> 28:22.850
I'm sorry.

28:25.930 --> 28:26.650
I'm sorry.

28:29.000 --> 28:30.370
I was wrong. I'm sorry.

28:41.810 --> 28:42.570
I'm sorry.

28:46.170 --> 28:46.850
I'm sorry.

28:48.980 --> 28:50.640
I'll accompany you to grow up.

29:59.930 --> 30:01.460
You'll sleep here tonight.

30:05.890 --> 30:06.750
What about you?

30:09.370 --> 30:10.630
I'll sleep on the sofa.

30:11.000 --> 30:13.260
You can see me
as soon as you open the door.

30:22.480 --> 30:23.090
Come on.

30:31.810 --> 30:33.810
You haven't slept well
these past few days.

30:33.810 --> 30:35.670
Get a good night's sleep tonight.

30:57.760 --> 30:58.670
Alright.

30:59.610 --> 31:00.470
Go to sleep now.

31:13.760 --> 31:15.160
I left a change of clothes

31:17.240 --> 31:18.170
there for you.

31:23.200 --> 31:24.000
Thank you.

32:15.170 --> 32:16.130
Let me do it.

32:16.130 --> 32:16.570
It's fine.

32:16.570 --> 32:17.720
Go take a seat.

32:18.090 --> 32:19.890
I'll come get you when it's done.

32:35.890 --> 32:37.570
It's raining heavily outside.

32:37.570 --> 32:39.500
The delivery guy spilled our food.

32:39.610 --> 32:41.540
So we won't be eating anytime soon.

32:41.930 --> 32:43.460
Have a glass of water first.

32:44.570 --> 32:45.370
Thank you.

32:50.090 --> 32:50.720
It's okay.

32:52.810 --> 32:54.410
We can order something else.

32:55.330 --> 32:56.660
See what you want to eat.

32:58.240 --> 32:59.240
Anything is fine.

33:01.480 --> 33:02.200
This one?

33:06.570 --> 33:07.170
Okay.

33:21.720 --> 33:23.520
What else do you want to do today?

33:27.930 --> 33:29.060
I don't know either.

33:37.570 --> 33:39.430
Look at how heavily it's raining.

33:41.440 --> 33:43.370
How about when the rain stops,

33:44.130 --> 33:45.200
we go for a walk?

33:49.720 --> 33:50.960
Gu Meng just told Jiang Fan

33:50.960 --> 33:52.560
that she wants to see you too.

33:54.330 --> 33:55.130
Sure.

33:56.000 --> 33:57.170
Then let's wait for the rain to stop,

33:57.170 --> 33:58.610
and we'll go for a stroll.

33:59.200 --> 33:59.720
For now,

33:59.720 --> 34:01.780
I need to find something for you to do.

34:05.280 --> 34:06.090
Why?

34:08.730 --> 34:10.860
Because we need to make your mind stop.

34:12.560 --> 34:13.929
If it doesn't stop, you'll keep thinking.

34:13.929 --> 34:16.590
And if you keep thinking,
you'll keep being sad.

34:21.000 --> 34:22.330
You seem to know it well.

34:25.889 --> 34:27.250
When my mom passed away,

34:27.850 --> 34:29.650
I suddenly became all alone too.

34:30.290 --> 34:31.690
I was like this back then,

34:33.929 --> 34:35.460
just about like you are now.

34:41.600 --> 34:42.929
You were so little then.

34:44.810 --> 34:46.810
But I still got through it, didn't I?

34:58.730 --> 34:59.410
It's okay.

35:02.250 --> 35:03.250
I'm here with you.

35:13.370 --> 35:14.960
My heart hurts so much.

35:20.000 --> 35:21.160
As time goes by,

35:21.160 --> 35:23.070
will it hurt less?

35:30.000 --> 35:33.810
But I really miss Grandma.

35:45.250 --> 35:46.080
She actually just

35:46.080 --> 35:47.290
stepped out of time.

35:49.370 --> 35:50.330
She returned to the universe's

35:50.330 --> 35:51.930
most primitive components.

35:54.370 --> 35:55.160
Molecules.

35:55.890 --> 35:56.600
Atoms.

36:00.370 --> 36:02.770
In the future,
she will slowly return to you

36:03.120 --> 36:04.290
in another form.

36:06.770 --> 36:08.900
Actually, you can think of it this way.

36:10.160 --> 36:11.440
When it rains heavily

36:11.440 --> 36:13.440
or the wind blows hard in the future,

36:15.690 --> 36:16.600
she can be the big tree

36:16.600 --> 36:18.860
that shelters you from the wind and rain.

36:19.160 --> 36:20.290
When winter comes,

36:22.120 --> 36:23.290
she can also be the sweater

36:23.290 --> 36:24.730
that keeps you warm.

36:32.120 --> 36:34.370
She just left you temporarily

36:34.600 --> 36:35.560
as your grandma.

36:37.640 --> 36:39.900
She will always be with you in the future.

36:54.730 --> 36:55.160
You know what?

36:55.160 --> 36:56.160
I had a very cute puppy

36:56.160 --> 36:57.410
when I was a kid.

37:02.000 --> 37:03.250
When it passed away,

37:04.520 --> 37:06.330
this is what my mother told me.

37:10.890 --> 37:12.420
When my mother passed away,

37:13.440 --> 37:14.770
I still believed in it.

37:20.040 --> 37:21.370
My mother once told me

37:24.810 --> 37:26.690
to believe in the power of belief.

37:29.960 --> 37:32.490
Your grandma will accompany you
in the future

37:34.080 --> 37:35.120
at any time

37:37.120 --> 37:38.210
and in any form.

37:42.080 --> 37:42.810
I would too.

38:14.210 --> 38:15.610
Do you believe in wishes?

38:17.370 --> 38:18.000
No.

38:21.330 --> 38:22.480
Before I was 9,

38:23.080 --> 38:24.730
I made a wish every birthday.

38:26.210 --> 38:28.330
I would write my wishes
on a piece of paper

38:28.330 --> 38:29.990
and hide them under my pillow.

38:31.930 --> 38:32.810
Dad said

38:33.370 --> 38:34.550
if I was a good child,

38:34.730 --> 38:36.190
my wishes would come true.

38:38.290 --> 38:39.730
Sometimes they did,

38:40.250 --> 38:41.580
sometimes they didn't.

38:42.520 --> 38:43.600
I asked my dad why.

38:44.560 --> 38:45.620
Guess what he said.

38:48.000 --> 38:48.860
What did he say?

38:49.440 --> 38:51.370
He said it was because I didn't blow out

38:51.370 --> 38:52.830
all the candles at once.

39:02.850 --> 39:03.850
After I turned 9,

39:04.040 --> 39:05.480
I never made a wish again.

39:07.000 --> 39:08.040
That birthday,

39:08.690 --> 39:09.810
I blew really hard.

39:12.600 --> 39:14.600
I hoped my wish would come true.

39:16.600 --> 39:17.600
I wished

39:19.290 --> 39:21.090
that my dad would stop coughing.

39:30.250 --> 39:31.110
What about now?

39:33.250 --> 39:34.520
Now that I'm grown up,

39:34.890 --> 39:37.020
I don't believe in that stuff anymore.

39:39.040 --> 39:41.040
If tomorrow was your birthday

39:41.250 --> 39:42.780
and you could make one wish,

39:43.600 --> 39:44.530
what would it be?

39:51.690 --> 39:54.680
I really want a bicycle.

39:57.480 --> 39:58.800
Once, after school,

39:58.930 --> 40:00.190
there was a heavy rain.

40:00.410 --> 40:01.730
I didn't have an umbrella,

40:01.730 --> 40:02.850
didn't want to bother anyone,

40:02.850 --> 40:04.450
and couldn't reach Grandma.

40:04.730 --> 40:05.770
So I ran all the way home

40:05.770 --> 40:06.600
in the rain.

40:07.250 --> 40:08.150
After that,

40:08.440 --> 40:09.600
I got really sick.

40:10.250 --> 40:11.220
It was awful.

40:11.730 --> 40:13.530
I only had one thought in my head:

40:13.930 --> 40:15.040
If only

40:15.040 --> 40:15.900
I had a bicycle.

40:16.250 --> 40:18.380
Then I could have gotten home earlier.

40:23.330 --> 40:24.890
You only have a birthday once a year,

40:24.890 --> 40:26.420
and you just want a bicycle?

40:27.370 --> 40:29.430
It's an obsession from my childhood.

40:33.600 --> 40:34.730
Starting tomorrow,

40:36.640 --> 40:38.300
I want to pull myself together

40:38.480 --> 40:40.080
and get back to a normal life.

40:42.440 --> 40:44.440
I'll go back to working at the arcade.

40:44.440 --> 40:45.810
I also want to move back.

40:47.290 --> 40:48.290
But don't worry,

40:49.160 --> 40:49.960
I'll be okay.

40:54.890 --> 40:55.520
Okay.

41:05.160 --> 41:06.640
There are so many seagulls.
